IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P6-art-51-52`

-- P6-tests-art-51-52: tests of Articles 51 and 52, written from the text. The expected value is beside each assertion and was decided from the text before the run.
-- Chapter V applies from 2 August 2025 (Art 113 third paragraph, point (b)). Art 111(3): a provider of a model placed on the market before 2 August 2025 has until 2 August 2027.
-- The argument order of each function is stated above its group of assertions: two BOOLEAN or two DATE arguments swapped would still type-check.

§ `Dates and models used in the tests`

`Art 51 test the day before the group applies` MEANS Date 1 8 2025
`Art 51 test the first day the group applies` MEANS Date 2 8 2025
`Art 51 test a later day` MEANS Date 1 3 2026
`Art 51 test the day before the legacy time ends` MEANS Date 1 8 2027
`Art 51 test the first day of the legacy time` MEANS Date 2 8 2027

-- A model placed on the market on 3 August 2025 (after the group begins to apply): the compute is the only thing that differs between the first three.
`Art 51 test model above the threshold` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 3 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

`Art 51 test model at the threshold` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 3 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_000

`Art 51 test model below the threshold` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 3 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 1_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_000

-- A model placed on the market on 1 August 2025, the last day before the group applies: Art 111(3) gives its provider until 2 August 2027.
`Art 51 test legacy model` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 1 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

-- A model placed on the market on 2 August 2025, the first day the group applies: no extra time.
`Art 51 test model placed on the first day` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 2 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

§ `Chapter V: when it applies, and Art 111(3)`

-- args: date asked
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 51 the group applies on the date asked` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies`)
#ASSERT `Art 51 the group applies on the date asked` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies`
#ASSERT `Art 51 the group applies on the date asked` `Art 51 test a later day`
-- args: date asked, model
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 51 the time to comply has come for the provider of the model on the date asked` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold`)
#ASSERT `Art 51 the time to comply has come for the provider of the model on the date asked` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold`
#ASSERT `Art 51 the time to comply has come for the provider of the model on the date asked` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` `Art 51 test model placed on the first day`
-- The legacy model: not before 2 August 2027, from that day on.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 51 the time to comply has come for the provider of the model on the date asked` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test legacy model`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 51 the time to comply has come for the provider of the model on the date asked` `Art 51 test the day before the legacy time ends` `Art 51 test legacy model`)
#ASSERT `Art 51 the time to comply has come for the provider of the model on the date asked` `Art 51 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 51 test legacy model`

-- The gate of a provider's duty. args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model
#ASSERT `Art 51 the obligations of the provider of the model are owed on the date asked` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51 the obligations of the provider of the model are owed on the date asked` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51 the obligations of the provider of the model are owed on the date asked` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51 the obligations of the provider of the model are owed on the date asked` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51 the obligations of the provider of the model are owed on the date asked` `Art 51 test the day before the legacy time ends` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51 the obligations of the provider of the model are owed on the date asked` `Art 51 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 51(2): the presumption (ten to the power twenty-five)`

-- args: date asked, model, the model is a general-purpose AI model
#ASSERT `Art 51(2) the model is presumed to have high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51(2) the model is presumed to have high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "greater than": exactly 10^25 is not presumed; one operation more is.
#ASSERT `Art 51(2) the model is presumed to have high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model at the threshold` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 51(2) the model is presumed to have high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51(2) the model is presumed to have high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model below the threshold` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not a general-purpose AI model: the paragraph does not speak to it.
#ASSERT `Art 51(2) the model is presumed to have high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The threshold is the exact literal.
#ASSERT `Art 51(2) the threshold of floating-point operations` EQUALS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_000

§ `Article 51(1): classification`

-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, high impact capabilities evaluated
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(a) the model meets the condition of high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(a) the model meets the condition of high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(a) the model meets the condition of high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model below the threshold` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(a) the model meets the condition of high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model below the threshold` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(a) the model meets the condition of high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model at the threshold` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(a) the model meets the condition of high impact capabilities` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, general-purpose AI model, the Commission has decided
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(b) the model meets the condition of a decision of the Commission` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(b) the model meets the condition of a decision of the Commission` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(b) the model meets the condition of a decision of the Commission` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1)(b) the model meets the condition of a decision of the Commission` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, high impact capabilities evaluated, the Commission has decided
#ASSERT `Art 51(1) the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51(1) the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1) the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model below the threshold` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1) the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model below the threshold` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1) the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model below the threshold` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1) the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model at the threshold` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 51(1) the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(3) does not delay the classification: the legacy model is classified from the day the group applies.
#ASSERT `Art 51(1) the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The seam S5 (a BOOLEAN): the same answers, with NOTHING and JUST FALSE both FALSE.
#ASSERT `Art 51 the general-purpose AI model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk under Article 51` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 51 the general-purpose AI model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk under Article 51` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model at the threshold` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Art 51 the general-purpose AI model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk under Article 51` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model below the threshold` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 51 the general-purpose AI model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk under Article 51` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 51 the general-purpose AI model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk under Article 51` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` FALSE TRUE TRUE)

§ `Article 51(3): delegated acts on the thresholds`

-- args: date asked, it is necessary for the thresholds to reflect the state of the art
#ASSERT `Art 51(3) the Commission must adopt delegated acts to amend the thresholds and to supplement benchmarks and indicators` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 51(3) the Commission must adopt delegated acts to amend the thresholds and to supplement benchmarks and indicators` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 51(3) the Commission must adopt delegated acts to amend the thresholds and to supplement benchmarks and indicators` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No time limit and no consequence: acting reads FULFILLED, waiting leaves the duty standing.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 51(3) the Commission's duty to adopt delegated acts` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 51 the Commission` DOES `Art 51(3) adopt delegated acts under Article 97 to amend the thresholds, and to supplement benchmarks and indicators` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 51(3) the Commission's duty to adopt delegated acts` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 51(3) the Commission's duty to adopt delegated acts` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

§ `Article 52(1): the notification`

-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider must notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider must notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider must notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider must notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(3): the provider of the legacy model owes the notification only from 2 August 2027; a model placed on the first day has no extra time.
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider must notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider must notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` `Art 51 test the day before the legacy time ends` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider must notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` `Art 51 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider must notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` `Art 51 test model placed on the first day` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- The time. args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, meets the condition, the date the period starts, the date notified, notified without delay
-- Fourteen days from 10 March 2026 is 24 March 2026; from 25 March 2026 it is 8 April 2026.
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 24 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 25 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE (Date 25 3 2026) (Date 8 4 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE (Date 25 3 2026) (Date 9 4 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE FALSE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the provider notified the Commission without delay and within two weeks` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The rule (day 0 is the day the two weeks start to run).
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, meets the condition
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 52(1) the provider's duty to notify the Commission` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 52(1) notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` AT 14
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 52(1) the provider's duty to notify the Commission` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 52(1) notify the Commission that the model meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a)` AT 15
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 52(1) the provider's duty to notify the Commission` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 15
-- The model does not meet the condition: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 52(1) the provider's duty to notify the Commission` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 30
-- The legacy model before 2 August 2027: nothing is owed; on that day the missed time is a breach.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 52(1) the provider's duty to notify the Commission` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 30
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 52(1) the provider's duty to notify the Commission` `Art 51 test the first day of the legacy time` `Art 51 test legacy model` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 30

-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, meets the condition, the notification includes the information
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the notification includes the information necessary to demonstrate that the relevant requirement has been met` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the notification includes the information necessary to demonstrate that the relevant requirement has been met` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the notification includes the information necessary to demonstrate that the relevant requirement has been met` `Art 51 test a later day` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the notification includes the information necessary to demonstrate that the relevant requirement has been met` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` `Art 51 test model above the threshold` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Third sentence. args: date asked, general-purpose AI model, the Commission becomes aware, the Commission has not been notified
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the Commission may decide to designate the model as a model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the Commission may decide to designate the model as a model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the Commission may decide to designate the model as a model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the Commission may decide to designate the model as a model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(1) the Commission may decide to designate the model as a model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 52(2): arguments that the model does not present systemic risks`

-- args: date asked, general-purpose AI model, meets the condition, the arguments are presented with the notification
#ASSERT `Art 52(2) the provider may present arguments that the model does not present systemic risks` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(2) the provider may present arguments that the model does not present systemic risks` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(2) the provider may present arguments that the model does not present systemic risks` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(2) the provider may present arguments that the model does not present systemic risks` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(2) the provider may present arguments that the model does not present systemic risks` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 52(3): rejecting the arguments`

-- args: date asked, general-purpose AI model, the Commission concludes the arguments are not sufficiently substantiated, the provider was not able to demonstrate
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the Commission must reject the arguments submitted pursuant to paragraph 2` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the Commission must reject the arguments submitted pursuant to paragraph 2` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the Commission must reject the arguments submitted pursuant to paragraph 2` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the Commission must reject the arguments submitted pursuant to paragraph 2` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the Commission must reject the arguments submitted pursuant to paragraph 2` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the model is considered to be a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the model is considered to be a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the model is considered to be a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(3) the model is considered to be a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- No time limit and no consequence.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 52(3) the Commission's duty to reject the arguments` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 51 the Commission` DOES `Art 52(3) reject the arguments submitted by the provider` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 52(3) the Commission's duty to reject the arguments` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 52(3) the Commission's duty to reject the arguments` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

§ `Article 52(4): designation and delegated acts`

-- args: date asked, general-purpose AI model, the designation is made on the basis of the criteria set out in Annex XIII
#ASSERT `Art 52(4) the Commission may designate the model as presenting systemic risks` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(4) the Commission may designate the model as presenting systemic risks` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(4) the Commission may designate the model as presenting systemic risks` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(4) the Commission may designate the model as presenting systemic risks` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked
#ASSERT `Art 52(4) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to amend Annex XIII by specifying and updating the criteria` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(4) the Commission may adopt delegated acts to amend Annex XIII by specifying and updating the criteria` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 52(5): reassessment`

-- args: date asked, the model has been designated, the provider has made a reasoned request
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the Commission must take the request into account` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the Commission must take the request into account` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the Commission must take the request into account` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the Commission must take the request into account` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the Commission may decide to reassess whether the model can still be considered to present systemic risks` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the Commission may decide to reassess whether the model can still be considered to present systemic risks` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the Commission may decide to reassess whether the model can still be considered to present systemic risks` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the Commission may decide to reassess whether the model can still be considered to present systemic risks` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, designated, objective, detailed, new, arisen since the designation decision
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the request contains objective, detailed and new reasons that have arisen since the designation decision` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the request contains objective, detailed and new reasons that have arisen since the designation decision` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the request contains objective, detailed and new reasons that have arisen since the designation decision` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the request contains objective, detailed and new reasons that have arisen since the designation decision` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the request contains objective, detailed and new reasons that have arisen since the designation decision` `Art 51 test a later day` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the request contains objective, detailed and new reasons that have arisen since the designation decision` `Art 51 test a later day` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the request contains objective, detailed and new reasons that have arisen since the designation decision` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The six months. args: date asked, designated, date of the designation decision, the designation was maintained, date of the decision to maintain, date of the request
-- Six months after 10 March 2026 is 10 September 2026: the day before is too early, the day itself is in time.
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` (Date 1 10 2027) TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 9 9 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` (Date 1 10 2027) TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 10 9 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- After a decision to maintain on 5 October 2026 the six months run from that decision: 5 April 2027.
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` (Date 1 10 2027) TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) TRUE (Date 5 10 2026) (Date 10 9 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` (Date 1 10 2027) TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) TRUE (Date 5 10 2026) (Date 4 4 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` (Date 1 10 2027) TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) TRUE (Date 5 10 2026) (Date 5 4 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Six months after 31 August 2026 clamps to 28 February 2027.
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` (Date 1 10 2027) TRUE (Date 31 8 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 27 2 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` (Date 1 10 2027) TRUE (Date 31 8 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 28 2 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not designated: outside the sentence. Before the group applies: not covered.
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` (Date 1 10 2027) FALSE (Date 10 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 10 9 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(5) the provider may request a reassessment on the date of the request` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 10 9 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 52(6): the list`

-- args: date asked
#ASSERT `Art 52(6) the Commission must ensure that the list of general-purpose AI models with systemic risk is published and kept up to date` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 52(6) the Commission must ensure that the list of general-purpose AI models with systemic risk is published and kept up to date` `Art 51 test the first day the group applies` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- No time limit and no consequence.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 52(6) the Commission's duty to publish the list and keep it up to date` `Art 51 test a later day` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 51 the Commission` DOES `Art 52(6) publish the list of general-purpose AI models with systemic risk and keep it up to date` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 52(6) the Commission's duty to publish the list and keep it up to date` `Art 51 test a later day` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 52(6) the Commission's duty to publish the list and keep it up to date` `Art 51 test the day before the group applies` AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
